  "student_passage": "I lost two (1) ____ (glove) on the bus last Friday. Our teacher had taken (2) ____ (we) to a sports centre, and we were tired on the way home. (3) ____ (Lucky), my friend noticed the gloves on the seat before the bus drove away. He jumped back inside to get them, but his water bottle (4) ____ (fall) out of his bag as he stepped down again.\n\nWe picked it up together. I felt much (5) ____ (happy) than I had a minute earlier because I had my gloves back. Then the rain began. Our teacher had (6) ____ umbrella, but it was not large enough for everyone. We talked about (7) ____ (go) into the shop nearby, although we had no money left to spend.\n\nWe waited (8) ____ the next bus under the shop's roof. The owner came out and told us we could stay there. A very (9) ____ (friend) driver stopped for our group when he saw the teacher wave. As soon (10) ____ we got inside, I put the gloves deep in my bag. This time, I checked the seat before getting off.",
