  "filled_passage": "I lost two (1) gloves (glove) on the bus last Friday. Our teacher had taken (2) us (we) to a sports centre, and we were tired on the way home. (3) Luckily (Lucky), my friend noticed the gloves on the seat before the bus drove away. He jumped back inside to get them, but his water bottle (4) fell (fall) out of his bag as he stepped down again.\n\nWe picked it up together. I felt much (5) happier (happy) than I had a minute earlier because I had my gloves back. Then the rain began. Our teacher had (6) an umbrella, but it was not large enough for everyone. We talked about (7) going (go) into the shop nearby, although we had no money left to spend.\n\nWe waited (8) for the next bus under the shop's roof. The owner came out and told us we could stay there. A very (9) friendly (friend) driver stopped for our group when he saw the teacher wave. As soon (10) as we got inside, I put the gloves deep in my bag. This time, I checked the seat before getting off.",
